---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How AlienX SmartHome uses inquiry information, website security data and saved preferences. No marketing signup."
>
  <p>
    AlienX SmartHome is personally operated in Wisconsin. This policy explains
    how information is handled through alienxsmarthome.com and its contact form.
    Questions can be sent to{' '}
    <a href="mailto:alienx@alienxsmarthome.com">alienx@alienxsmarthome.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Information you choose to share</h2>
  <p>
    The contact form collects your name, email address, preferred contact
    method, project type, message and permission to respond. You may also
    provide a phone number, company, website, preferred contact time, time zone,
    timeline, budget range and how you found AlienX. A phone number is required
    when you select phone or text as your preferred contact method.
  </p>
  <p>
    These details are used to respond to your inquiry and discuss your project.
    Submitting the form does not subscribe you to a newsletter or marketing
    messages. Inquiry information is not used for marketing.
  </p>
  <p>
    Please do not submit passwords, access codes, payment-card details,
    sensitive personal information or information about another person that you
    are not authorized to share.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting, spam protection and email</h2>
  <p>
    Cloudflare hosts and protects the website. Its Turnstile security check
    processes technical signals, such as an IP address and browser information,
    to help distinguish people from automated traffic. The application also uses
    an IP address for rate limiting and request identifiers for troubleshooting.
  </p>
  <p>
    Resend delivers the details you submit by email to the AlienX inbox. Your
    email address is included so AlienX can reply. Hosting, email delivery and
    mailbox providers process information needed to provide these services;
    their systems may process it outside Wisconsin or the United States.
  </p>
  <p>
    Read the{' '}
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">
      Cloudflare Privacy Policy
    </a>
    ,{' '}
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/">
      Turnstile Privacy Addendum
    </a>{' '}
    and{' '}
    <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy">Resend Privacy Policy</a>{' '}
    for their descriptions of data handling.
  </p>

  <h2>Preferences and technical records</h2>
  <p>
    The website saves your theme and motion preferences in your browser's local
    storage. You can change them with the site controls or remove them through
    your browser settings. These preferences are separate from your inquiry.
  </p>
  <p>
    Security and delivery records can include timestamps, request identifiers,
    delivery identifiers and error categories. Cloudflare may also process
    request and browser information through its hosting and security services.
    This policy does not promise that visiting the site is anonymous or that no
    technical records are created.
  </p>

  <h2>Retention, security and your choices</h2>
  <p>
    Submitted messages can remain in the AlienX mailbox, email-service records
    and backups after the form finishes. Clearing your browser does not delete
    those copies. Retention depends on handling the inquiry or project,
    applicable legal obligations and the providers' record and backup practices;
    there is no automatic deletion deadline promised by this form.
  </p>
  <p>
    To ask about your information, request access, correction or deletion, or
    ask AlienX to stop contacting you about an inquiry, email{' '}
    <a href="mailto:alienx@alienxsmarthome.com">alienx@alienxsmarthome.com</a>.
    Please identify the inquiry without sending passwords or identity documents.
    Verification may be needed before acting on a request. Some records may need
    to be retained where required by law or to resolve a dispute.
  </p>
  <p>
    Security checks and access controls reduce risk, but no website or email
    system can guarantee complete security. Use the contact address above if you
    believe you submitted sensitive information by mistake.
  </p>

  <h2>Other websites and changes</h2>
  <p>
    External links lead to services with their own policies. This policy covers
    this public website and its inquiries, not every linked service or a
    separately agreed project. Updates will be posted here with a revised date.
  </p>
</PolicyLayout>
